- CMMC Buyers: DIB vendors, defense contractors, MSP/MSSP/software/security teams, executives, security/GRC/compliance owners, or technical operators who may need CMMC/NIST 800-171 readiness, CUI evidence, SSP/POA&M upkeep, or assessment-prep workflows.
- CMMC Advisor/Channel: CMMC advisors, C3PAOs, RPOs, vCISOs, consultants, MSPs/MSSPs, assessors, partner/channel firms, and ecosystem contacts who help DIB clients prepare for or deliver CMMC/NIST 800-171 work.

